  - VR
repository-code: "https://github.com/vicvalentim/ziviDomeLive"
abstract: >
  ziviDomeLive is a Java library for the Processing platform that streamlines the
  development of real-time visual experiences for fulldome projection, mono VR and
  other immersive installations. It provides explicit render modes, independent
  Standard and spherical pipelines, dynamic resolution switching, scene lifecycle
  management, and optional NDI, Syphon, or Spout routing for live video output.
